{"E:\\videos\\helen5\\wt\\vlog\\helen5\\voz\\b000_t2.wav": {"text": "I am 68 and I cook for one. And last Monday, a lady named Dolores put one $20 bill on my counter. She is 81, she lives alone, and she said, Helen, this is all I have for meat this week. Most people would sell her two packs and wish her luck. I bagged up $19.91 of meat and I wrote her a little plan on the back of an order slip. Saturday she came back with a slip in her hand 14 suppers and lunches with real meat in them and she still had a little sausage left over today I am going to give you every trick on that slip and a few more the same ones I use in my own kitchen so $20 of meat lasts you a whole week too I am going to give you 25 butcher tricks in the order you use them from the meat counter on Sunday to the Last Supper on Saturday.", "words": [{"w": " I", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.34}, {"w": " am", "s": 0.34, "e": 0.5}, {"w": " 68", "s": 0.5, "e": 1.24}, {"w": " and", "s": 1.24, "e": 1.66}, {"w": " I", "s": 1.66, "e": 1.9}, {"w": " cook", "s": 1.9, "e": 2.1}, {"w": " for", "s": 2.1, "e": 2.42}, {"w": " one.", "s": 2.42, "e": 3.2}, {"w": " And", "s": 3.24, "e": 3.42}, {"w": " last", "s": 3.42, "e": 3.7}, {"w": " Monday,", "s": 3.7, "e": 4.16}, {"w": " a", "s": 4.16, "e": 4.42}, {"w": " lady", "s": 4.42, "e": 4.74}, {"w": " named", "s": 4.74, "e": 5.08}, {"w": " Dolores", "s": 5.08, "e": 5.56}, {"w": " put", "s": 5.56, "e": 5.94}, {"w": " one $20", "s": 5.94, "e": 6.94}, {"w": " bill", "s": 6.94, "e": 7.44}, {"w": " on", "s": 7.44, "e": 7.7}, {"w": " my", "s": 7.7, "e": 7.92}, {"w": " counter.", "s": 7.92, "e": 8.84}, {"w": " She", "s": 8.94, "e": 9.08}, {"w": " is", "s": 9.08, "e": 9.36}, {"w": " 81,", "s": 9.36, "e": 10.38}, {"w": " she", "s": 10.38, "e": 10.52}, {"w": " lives", "s": 10.52, "e": 10.86}, {"w": " alone,", "s": 10.86, "e": 11.72}, {"w": " and", "s": 11.72, "e": 11.82}, {"w": " she", "s": 11.82, "e": 12.02}, {"w": " said,", "s": 12.02, "e": 12.84}, {"w": " Helen,", "s": 12.52, "e": 13.12},